Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by storing the IRQ value in an unsigned integer, which could lead to the loss of negative error codes returned by the `platform_get_irq_byname()` function. This incorrect type usage meant that any error during IRQ registration could be misrepresented, potentially leading to undefined behavior or failure to handle the error properly.

